<title>UK: Wuestenrot Bank sets 500 mln mark 8-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Wuestenrot Bank sets 500 mln mark 8-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUESTENROT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    29.AUG.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +12.5 BP  PAY DATE    29.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.055   FULL FEES   0.2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
